# Density Compare
# Fermium (Fm) — real density 9.7 g/cm³. equal masses: Fermium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Fermium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.4mm color: #20ff00 at (-20mm, 4.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 77.4 g — the water cube is the reference
